Package: sogo-fc5
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Local integration <local@localhost>
Section: non-free/utils
Priority: optional
Depends: fcitx5 (>= 5.1.7), libfcitx5core7, libfcitx5config6, libfcitx5utils2, fcitx5-frontend-gtk3, fcitx5-frontend-gtk4, fcitx5-frontend-qt5, fcitx5-frontend-qt6, fcitx5-config-qt, fonts-noto-cjk, libc6 (>= 2.38), libstdc++6 (>= 13.1), libgcc-s1, libqt5core5t64 (>= 5.15), libqt5gui5t64, libqt5widgets5t64, libqt5dbus5t64, libgsettings-qt1, libglib2.0-0t64, libfontconfig1, libcairo2, librsvg2-2, libdbus-1-3, libpixman-1-0, libx11-6, libxtst6, libgomp1, libasound2t64, libpulse0, libsndio7.0, libudev1, libxext6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxxf86vm1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libxkbcommon0, libzstd1, zlib1g
Description: Sogo-FC5 input method using the official Sogou FC4 engine
 Uses the official 4.2.1.145 Sogou engine and dictionaries through
 reconstructed binary interfaces, with native Fcitx5 composition and
 candidate presentation. Engine processing runs in a separate process.
 Real engine conversion and desktop behavior require manual verification.
